<Paragraph>Hello Sheep Councillor {contact.firstName}!</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>As usual, we’ll see you on <Strong textColor="#6d28d9">Monday Aug 24, 9am PT</Strong>. We’ve got some more updates for you:</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<UnorderedList>
  <ListItem>BAML 0.17.0 is now live: run <Code>baml toolchain update</Code> to pick it up (<Link href="https://github.com/BoundaryML/baml/blob/canary/baml_language/CHANGELOG.md#0170---2026-08-14"><Underline>click here to see the changelog</Underline></Link>)!</ListItem>
  <ListItem>We’ll show off the <Text textColor="#6d28d9">new query language for Boundary Studio</Text>!</ListItem>
  <ListItem>We’ve landed TypeBuilder and code-mode, and added some additional changes to make them easier to use.</ListItem>
</UnorderedList>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>Also, thanks to Ben, Maceo, Brian, Gerardo, and Ritunjay for all the issues you filed - it's a huge help to have y'all pushing us forward :)</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>If you're interested in seeing a demo, sharing feedback about your use case, and influencing how BAML does this, don't miss Monday's meeting at 9am PT!</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
